  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BioLib 4.3.2 updates core imaging and scripting dependencies:\n- Updates BioFormats.NET6 to 9.0.0-rc2 and unifies Bio-Formats, Fiji, and OMERO on IKVM11 8.15.2 with the macOS native JVM image.\n- Updates ZarrNET to 0.8.2 for the latest OME-Zarr compatibility and fixes.\n- Updates SkiaSharp to 4.156.1 and CS-Script to 4.14.14.\n- Much better MacOS support, like Java AWT GUI fully works now.",
